title: Declarations
tags: setup
---
// Never run this node. It only holds variable declarations for Yarn Spinner 2.4+/3.
// Delete the <<declare>> lines if your project uses an older version or declares variables in code.

<<declare $dressed = false>>
<<declare $lila_intro_done = false>>
<<declare $talked_basketball = false>>
<<declare $talked_neighbor = false>>
<<declare $classroom_intro_done = false>>
// Empty until the player picks the cafeteria or the music room in Classroom_Enter. Until then the Observant Student appears in neither.
<<declare $clue_location = "">>
<<declare $found_clue = false>>
<<declare $park_intro_done = false>>
<<declare $found_redbook = false>>
<<declare $found_dira = false>>
<<declare $found_kirana = false>>
===

title: Prologue
tags: cutscene
---
<<scene_load "SchoolPark" "Prologue">>
Narrator: The school festival is in full swing. Bazaar stalls line the paths, a band plays on a makeshift stage, and students crowd around game booths, laughing and trading snacks. Every corner has something going on. For one afternoon, the school looks like a utopia.
Narrator: The camera drifts through the crowd and settles on Anin, standing at the edge of it all.
Anin: (to herself) What a fun day... I still can't believe the best three years of my life end tomorrow. What's everyone going to do after graduation?
Narrator: Kirana, Dira, and Lila push through the crowd toward her.
Kirana: There you are! What took you so long?
Lila: I didn't know you could take a nap in the bathroom.
Dira: Okay, enough, you two. Let's go try the gulali from class 1-C.
Narrator: The three of them walk ahead, bickering and laughing. Anin hangs back a step and watches them, a sight she will never forget.
Anin: (quietly) I don't want this to end. I wish I could stay in high school forever.
<<sound_cut>>
Narrator: All sound cuts out. For one second, the world holds perfectly still.
<<sound_resume>>
Narrator: Then the noise rushes back. Anin blinks, shakes it off, and hurries after her friends.
<<title_card>>
<<jump Dorm_Intro>>
===

title: Dorm_Intro
tags: cutscene dorm
---
<<scene_load "Dorm" "Morning">>
<<sfx "alarm_clock">>
// Narrator: An alarm blares. Anin's hand gropes out from under the blanket and slaps at the clock until it stops.
Anin: Good morn... huh?
(Kirana's bed is empty.)
Anin: Where's Kirana? There's no way she'd leave without me. Not on graduation day.
<<give_control>>
<<quest_start "graduation_day" "Get ready for the ceremony.">>
===

title: Dorm_Bed
tags: interactable dorm
---
Anin: No time to lie around, Anin...
===

title: Dorm_Poster
